    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36933" root="كسب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسُوبٌ</span></b>  [so in the copies of the K in my
hands; but by the place in which it is mentioned
in the TA, it is implied that it is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسُّوبٌ</span></b> : see
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسُوبٌ</span>] <i>A thing; anything.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا لَهُ كَسُوبٌ</span>
<i>He has not anything.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ كَسُوبٌ</span>,
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسَّابٌ</span></b> , <i>A man who makes much gain.</i>
(K.)

